@startuml
title Vision Realtime 期望时序：端侧视角

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Mic Capture\n麦克风采集" as Mic
participant "Local Wake Detector\n本地语音唤醒" as Wake
participant "Audio Preprocess\nAEC/NS/AGC" as Preprocess
participant "Control WS Client\n控制长连接" as Control
participant "Upstream Audio WS\n上行音频长连接" as Upstream
participant "Downstream Audio WS\n下行音频长连接" as Downstream
queue "Downlink Audio Queue\n下行音频缓存队列" as Queue
participant "Speaker Playback\n扬声器播放" as Speaker
participant "RealtimeAgent Server\n服务器" as Server

== 1. 本地持续采集与语音唤醒 ==

Mic -> Wake: continuous mic frames

loop before wake detected
  Mic -> Wake: raw mic frame
  Wake -> Wake: local wake strategy\nbutton / auto / keyword
end

note over Mic,Wake
端侧可按自己的策略开启麦克风。
唤醒成功前，麦克风音频只在端侧用于唤醒检测，
不发送给服务器。
end note

== 2. 唤醒成功后建立连续对话连接 ==

Wake -> Control: wake detected
Control -> Server: control.user.wake.detected
Server --> Control: control.audio_session.open.requested
Control -> Server: control.audio_session.opened

Upstream -> Server: open upstream audio ws\nsensor.mic
Downstream -> Server: open downstream audio ws\nactuator.speaker

note over Upstream,Downstream
上行音频连接和下行音频连接是两个独立长连接。
唤醒后进入连续对话，直到服务器要求关闭 audio_session。
end note

== 3. 连续上行：麦克风音频始终发送给服务器 ==

loop until audio_session.close requested
  Mic -> Preprocess: raw mic frame
  Preprocess -> Upstream: PCM chunk
  Upstream -> Server: sensor.mic chunk
end

note over Preprocess
端侧 AEC/NS/AGC 只做音频质量处理。
端侧不做 VAD，不生成 speech_start / speech_stop。
end note

== 4. 接收服务器 VAD 事件 ==

Server --> Control: speech_start
Control -> Control: record user_speaking=true
Server --> Control: speech_stop
Control -> Control: record user_speaking=false

note over Control
speech_start / speech_stop 来自服务器。
端侧只更新本地播放控制状态，
不据此提交用户输入。
end note

== 5. 接收下行音频并启动播放 ==

Server --> Downstream: assistant audio chunk
Downstream -> Queue: enqueue audio chunk
Queue -> Speaker: write first playable chunk
Speaker -> Speaker: start playback

loop while assistant audio response is not complete
  Server --> Downstream: assistant audio chunk
  Downstream -> Queue: enqueue audio chunk
  Queue -> Speaker: write next chunk when playable
end

== 6. 下行缓存队列水位控制 ==

alt queue high watermark reached
  Queue -> Control: queue almost full
  Control -> Server: downstream.pause.requested
else queue low watermark reached
  Queue -> Control: queue needs more audio
  Control -> Server: downstream.resume.requested
end

note over Queue,Speaker
浏览器维护自己的下行音频缓存队列。
完整音频响应结束前，队列应尽量保持既不空也不满：
队列空会导致播放卡顿，队列满会导致网络/内存压力。
end note

== 7. 播放期间收到服务器 speech_start ==

Server --> Control: speech_start
Control -> Speaker: is playing?

alt speaker is playing
  Control -> Speaker: pause writing to player
  Control -> Queue: clear queued but not played audio
  Control -> Server: playback.paused_for_speech_start
else speaker is not playing
  Control -> Control: only record speech_start
end

note over Speaker,Queue
暂停播放动作指停止继续向播放器写入新音频。
已收到但尚未播放的下行缓存必须清空。
end note

== 8. 服务器决定关闭连续对话 ==

Server --> Control: audio_session.close.requested
Control -> Upstream: close upstream immediately
Upstream -> Server: upstream closed

Control -> Queue: stop accepting new audio
Queue -> Speaker: wait current played audio finish
Speaker -> Control: playback drained

Control -> Downstream: close downstream audio ws
Downstream -> Server: downstream closed
Control -> Server: control.audio_session.closed

== 9. 回到等待语音唤醒 ==

Control -> Wake: audio session closed
Wake -> Wake: return to local wake detection
Mic -> Wake: continuous mic frames

@enduml
